            },
            "kind": "NO_CODE_CHANGE",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1965,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "How does User.Attributes::UserPasswordExpired get updated?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1965,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vijaysankar Ravi",
                        "email": "vijaysankarr@ami.com",
                        "username": "Vijaysankarr"
                    },
                    "message": "UserPasswordExpired reads /etc/shadow live via getspnam_r() on every access, no explicit update needed.\n\nVerified:\nSetPasswordExpired true/false reflects correctly on the UserPasswordExpired property.\n\nonce dbus changes confirmed, will change the current implementation acc to that."
                },
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1972,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "You gave a very misleading response in the phosphor-dbus-interfaces.  You implied this exception was coming from executeCmd, which isn't true.\n\n> The executeCmd() template in user_mgr.hpp throws InternalFailure on any command execution failure.\n\nIt isn't.  It came from your new code."
                },
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1972,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vijaysankar Ravi",
                        "email": "vijaysankarr@ami.com",
                        "username": "Vijaysankarr"
                    },
                    "message": "No. executeCmd() itself throws InternalFailure on any command failure.\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-user-manager/blob/d53101d9826111862e583b7a64545afd033960fe/user_mgr.hpp#L120\n\nRemoving the explicit catch still propagates InternalFailure."
                },
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1975,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I'd prefer we do not support this leg."
                },
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1975,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vijaysankar Ravi",
                        "email": "vijaysankarr@ami.com",
                        "username": "Vijaysankarr"
                    },
                    "message": "once dbus changes confirmed, will change the current implementation acc to that."
                },
                {
                    "file": "user_mgr.cpp",
                    "line": 1975,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vijaysankar Ravi",
                        "email": "vijaysankarr@ami.com",
                        "username": "Vijaysankarr"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                }
            ],
